<title>USA: Laser Vision converts preferred.</title>
<headline>Laser Vision converts preferred.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laser Vision Centers Inc said Tuesday holders of the company's 141,000 shares of convertible preferred stock have converted their holdings into 2,349,991 shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Following the conversion, Laser Vision Centers has about 8.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
